# IG demo / live credentials for blive — TEMPLATE.
#
# Per ADR-035 (docs/decisions/DECISIONS.md#adr-035--secrets-handling-discipline-blivesecrets):
#   - Copy this file to ~/.blive/secrets/ig.env (NOT in this repo).
#   - Replace placeholder values with real credentials.
#   - chmod 600 the destination file (Linux/macOS).
#   - Real .env files are gitignored; only this .example file is committed.
#   - Env vars override file values, so Docker / CI can inject without writing the file.
#
# Required fields:
IG_API_KEY=replace-with-your-ig-api-key
IG_USERNAME=replace-with-your-ig-username
IG_PASSWORD=replace-with-your-ig-password
IG_ACCOUNT_ID=replace-with-your-ig-account-id
IG_ENVIRONMENT=demo
# IG_ENVIRONMENT must be either "demo" or "live"; per [ADR-039]
# (docs/decisions/DECISIONS.md#adr-039--phase-1-strategy-under-ig-bridge-cac-40-cfd)
# the M2-IG bridge runs on demo only.
